    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p>*UPDATES SEPTEMBER 2023\r\n\r\n*New music tracks.\r\n\r\n*Updated aesthetics within the menus.\r\n\r\n*Updated maps.\r\n\r\n*A scoring system has been added.\r\n\r\n*The game is now in full-screen mode.\r\n\r\n*A limited shooting system has been implemented.\r\n\r\n*The option to reset, exit, and disable music with buttons has been added.\r\n\r\n*New effects have been added when shooting, accompanied by a different sound.\r\n\r\n*Issues with shooting and restarting the game have been resolved.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Simple and entertaining 2d game, for two players locally, in different scenarios, very easy to play with just a keyboard, a few keys, and see who is the most skilled on each map, in a house, factory or laboratory, your you decide!",
